# ⚔️ AETHERIA — BASIC COMBAT SYSTEM

> **A battle is not only a calculation of strength.**
>
> **A Hero fights with their body, mind, emotions, memories, and will to survive.**
>
> **The Master commands.**
>
> **The Heroes act.**
>
> **The Fairy observes.**
>
> **The World reacts.**
>
> **When a Hero dies, that death is permanent.**

The **Basic Combat System** is the foundational battle framework of Aetheria.

The system controls combat between:

```text
Hero
Enemy
Boss
NPC
Faction
Monster
Cult
World Entity
```

Combat is not completely deterministic.

Hero behavior, decision-making, performance, and reactions can be influenced by:

```text
AI
Character Personality
Emotional State
Morale
Stress
Fear
Trust
Relationships
Health
Stamina
Skills
Equipment
Enemy Strength
Floor Condition
Destruction Level
Game State
Battle Events
```

The **AI Fairy** continuously observes the battlefield and reports important combat conditions to the Master.

---

