# 33. DESTRUCTION LEVEL

The difficulty of the world is directly connected to the **Destruction Level** established by the Core World Building.

Destruction Level represents the degree of Nythar's corruption.

```text
Destruction Level
        ↓
World Condition
        ↓
Floor Condition
        ↓
Enemy Condition
        ↓
Combat Difficulty
        ↓
Permanent Death Risk
```

---

# 34. DESTRUCTION LEVEL ≠ ONLY ENEMY STATS

Higher destruction does not simply mean:

```text
Enemy HP +100%
Enemy ATK +100%
```

It can influence the entire combat environment.

For example:

```text
Enemy Behavior
Environment
Visibility
Mana Stability
Enemy Spawn
Resources
Character Stress
Character Fear
Battle Events
Permanent Death Risk
```

---

# 35. DESTRUCTION TIERS

The basic world scale:

```text
50%  → High Destruction
60%  → Severe Ruin
70%  → Extreme Corruption
80%  → Critical Destruction
90%  → Near Collapse
95%  → Almost Complete
99%  → Maximum Ruin
100% → Nythar Domain
```

The exact values are controlled by the Game State System.

