# 40. COMBAT DIFFICULTY

Combat difficulty is calculated from multiple variables.

```text
Combat Difficulty =
Enemy Strength
+
Enemy AI
+
Floor Difficulty
+
Destruction Level
+
Environmental Hazard
+
Character Condition
+
Resource Availability
+
Battle Event
+
Permanent Death Risk
```

---

# 41. DIFFICULTY SHOULD NOT BE PURE STAT SCALING

The system should avoid simply increasing enemy HP.

Instead:

```text
LOWER FLOOR
→ Simple enemy behavior

MID FLOOR
→ Tactical enemies

HIGH FLOOR
→ Coordinated enemies

EXTREME DESTRUCTION
→ Unpredictable enemies
→ Severe permanent death risk
```

This creates more meaningful difficulty.

