# 46. RNG RULE

Combat should not create a completely separate RNG system.

Instead:

```text
BASIC COMBAT
      ↓
REQUEST RNG
      ↓
RNG SYSTEM
      ↓
RESULT
      ↓
COMBAT
```

This keeps all random systems centralized.

