# 66. HERO DEATH

Hero death is permanent and must be treated as a major Game State event.

```text
HERO HP = 0
      ↓
DEATH CHECK
      ↓
PERMANENT DEATH CONFIRMED
      ↓
CHARACTER STATE = DEAD PERMANENTLY
      ↓
REMOVE FROM ACTIVE PARTY
      ↓
DISABLE AI
      ↓
DISABLE COMBAT ACTIONS
      ↓
EMOTIONAL IMPACT
      ↓
PARTY RELATIONSHIP IMPACT
      ↓
GAME STATE
      ↓
EVENT SYSTEM
      ↓
DATABASE
```

There is no standard revival path.

The following cannot restore a permanently dead Hero:

```text
Health Potion
Healing Skill
Revival Item
Revival Skill
Rest
Save Reload
Ordinary Event
```

Any exception must be explicitly defined as a separate story rule and must not be part of the standard combat system.

