Severe Injury
```

Possible effects:

```text
Reduced Combat Performance
Higher Stress
Reduced Morale
Temporary Skill Restriction
Recovery Requirement
```

Injury is different from death.

```text
Injured:
Can Recover

Dead Permanently:
Cannot Return
```

