# 68. RETREAT

Retreat can be a valid combat action.

The AI may recommend retreat when:

```text
Party HP Critical
Enemy Overwhelming
Destruction Extreme
Resources Low
Boss Too Strong
Objective Already Completed
Permanent Death Risk High
```

The Master decides whether to retreat.

Retreat can prevent future deaths, but it cannot restore a Hero who has already died permanently.

