# 89. CORE RULES

### Rule 1

> **Combat is controlled by AI, not by fixed scripts alone.**

### Rule 2

> **Hero emotional state can change combat behavior.**

### Rule 3

> **Personality affects tactical decisions.**

### Rule 4

> **Master commands influence Heroes but do not completely erase their individuality.**

### Rule 5

> **Destruction Level affects the difficulty and condition of the battlefield.**

### Rule 6

> **High difficulty should come from behavior and environment, not only inflated enemy statistics.**

### Rule 7

> **RNG remains centralized in the RNG System.**

### Rule 8

> **Important battle changes are synchronized through the Game State System.**

### Rule 9

> **Persistent battle information is stored in the Database System.**

### Rule 10

> **The AI Fairy observes and reports important events to the Master.**

### Rule 11

> **A Hero who dies is dead permanently.**

### Rule 12

> **Standard healing, revival, rest, save reload, and ordinary events cannot restore a permanently dead Hero.**

### Rule 13

> **A permanently dead Hero cannot return to combat, receive progression, or be controlled by AI.**

### Rule 14

> **Permanent death must be recorded in the Game State System and Database System.**

